sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as NestJS API
    participant R as Redis (QuotaService Lua)
    participant P as Postgres (FORCE RLS)
    participant W as Worker (BullMQ + Outbox)

    C->>A: POST /usage/events (idempotencyKey, metric, quantity)
    A->>R: reserve(org, metric, qty, limit) via reserveLua
    alt quota exceeded
        R-->>A: {allowed: false}
        A-->>C: 429 Quota Exceeded
    else reserved
        R-->>A: {allowed: true, softAlert}
        A->>P: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.organization_id
        A->>P: INSERT usage_events ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
        alt duplicate key
            A->>R: release(org, metric, qty)
            A-->>C: 201 {duplicate: true}
        else new event
            A->>P: INSERT outbox ('usage.recorded') + COMMIT
            A->>R: commit(org, metric, qty) -> decrby reserved, incrby used
            A-->>C: 201 {accepted: true, eventId}
        end
    end
    W->>P: SELECT outbox WHERE published_at IS NULL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    W->>W: BullMQ job -> INSERT processed_events ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    W->>P: UPSERT usage_aggregates hourly bucket
